============================================================
1. PROJECT DESCRIPTION
============================================================

Project name: Kiroku
Platform: .NET MAUI — Android (phone + tablet adaptive)
Description:
  Corporate expense management app. Employees submit expense
  tickets (meals, fuel, hotel, public transport, tolls, parking,
  and other business expenses). Admins approve or reject them.
  Employees see real-time status of their submissions.

Roles:
  - Administratzailea (Admin):
      * Approves or rejects employee tickets
      * Creates their OWN expense tickets directly (auto-approved,
        no confirmation needed from anyone)
      * Views all employees and all tickets
      * Has a completely separate tab/navigation set from employees
  - Langilea (Employee):
      * Submits expense tickets for approval
      * Can ONLY see their own tickets — never other users' data
      * Tracks status of their own submissions
      * Has their own dedicated tab set, separate from admin

