============================================================
3. TECHNOLOGY STACK
============================================================

- Language:        C# 13 / .NET 9
- UI Framework:    .NET MAUI + XAML
- Local DB:        SQLite via sqlite-net-pcl
- Online DB:       Turso (libSQL) — SQLite wire-compatible
    Migration path: swap SQLiteAsyncConnection for LibSQLConnection
    and update connection string. ~95% of SQL stays unchanged.
- ORM:             sqlite-net-pcl (LibSQL.Client for online)
- MVVM:            CommunityToolkit.Mvvm
- DI:              Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection (MAUI built-in)
- Images:          MediaPicker (MAUI built-in) + upload to Cloudinary
- Image storage:   Server-side (see §9) — DB stores URL/path only
- Auth:            SecureStorage + SHA256 + salt (local) / JWT (online)

