8. DATABASE RULES
============================================================

  - Single connection (singleton) in DatuBaseaZerbitzua
  - Always async: CreateTableAsync, InsertAsync, QueryAsync...
  - NEVER access the database on the UI thread — always await
  - Maintain a DatabaseVersion constant for migration tracking
  - Follow the SortzeAginduak pattern already in the project
  - Indexes required on: ErabiltzaileId, TxartelEgoera

Turso (libSQL) migration when ready:
  1. Replace sqlite-net-pcl with LibSQL.Client NuGet
  2. Replace SQLiteAsyncConnection with LibSQLConnection
  3. Connection string MUST be built using environment variables.
     - Use a .env file (e.g., via DotNetEnv package) for local dev.
     - NEVER hardcode the libsql:// URL or the JWT auth token in the code.
  4. Everything else stays identical

